  "prefLabel": "He-P 4070.04 Method of Payment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4070.04 Method of Payment.\n\n(a) Fee payment shall be:\n\n(1) In cash; or\n\n(2) By check or money order made payable to “Treasurer - State of New Hampshire”.\n\n(b) The payments may be made by personal delivery or by mail.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p4062-4097.html"
